# These two plugins derive their data.json from vault *content* rather than
# settings — codeblock-language-detector caches indexed code blocks verbatim,
# colored-tags accumulates every tag name it has seen. Both have leaked private
# notes into this public repo before. Other plugin-data/ files are static
# settings that install.sh needs, so they stay tracked.
obsidian/plugin-data/codeblock-language-detector/data.json
obsidian/plugin-data/colored-tags/data.json
